# Trivy ignore list for fulmen-toolbox runner / sbom-tools images.
#
# Add CVEs here only with rationale and a date. Format:
#   <CVE-ID>  # YYYY-MM-DD: <rationale>; review by YYYY-MM-DD
#
# This file is read by the cve-scan workflow and by `make precommit` (trivy
# scan of Dockerfile sources). Keep entries minimal and time-boxed.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ADMISSION RULE: an entry belongs here only if the fix is genuinely out of our
# reach — the fix exists in a dependency, but no upstream release of the tool we
# ship carries it yet, AND we are already on that tool's latest release.
# "We haven't gotten to it" is not a rationale; bump the pin instead.
#
# v0.5.8 (2026-10-10): Docker was not available in this pin-refresh environment,
# so waivers were re-evaluated from upstream go.mod of the new pins (syft
# v1.54.0, grype v0.120.0, trivy v0.75.0) rather than a rebuilt-image scan.
# Dropped trivy-only waivers that those go.mod files show as cleared, and
# dropped syft/grype Go-stdlib waivers whose fix line is older than the
# toolchain those releases require. Re-scan published images after GA and drop
# anything that no longer appears. Do not carry an entry forward on trust.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Go stdlib embedded in PREBUILT upstream binaries ------------------------
# yq v4.53.3 remains built with go1.26.4 (unchanged pin). syft v1.56.0,
# grype v0.121.1 and trivy v0.76.1 are built with go1.27.3, past the go1.26.5
# stdlib fix line. This leftover needs go1.26.5.
CVE-2026-39822  # 2026-10-10: stdlib in prebuilt yq v4.53.3 (go1.26.4); needs go1.26.5; yq pin unchanged; review by 2026-12-31

# --- golang.org/x/text in prebuilt / upstream-pinned binaries ----------------
# One remaining carrier: yq v4.53.3 (unchanged pin) -> x/text v0.37.0.
# golangci-lint v2.14.0 selects x/text v0.41.0 and trivy v0.76.1 vendors a
# release past the v0.39.0 fix, so neither is a carrier. Clears when the yq pin
# moves to a release built with x/text v0.39.0 or later.
CVE-2026-56852  # 2026-11-10: x/text in yq v4.53.3 (v0.37.0); fixed in v0.39.0; golangci-lint v2.14.0 and trivy v0.76.1 no longer carriers; review by 2026-12-31

# --- Vendored dependencies in prebuilt upstream binaries ---------------------
# grype still vendors github.com/docker/docker v28.5.2 (fixed in v29.3.1).
# Re-checked 2026-11-10 against grype v0.121.1 go.mod — the dependency is
# unchanged, so the version bump taken this cycle did not clear it.
CVE-2026-34040  # 2026-11-10: grype v0.121.1 vendors docker/docker v28.5.2; fixed in 29.3.1; on-latest-upstream; review by 2026-12-31
